}}'''Thieving and Boss Crabominable''' (Japanese: '''強奪！！首領・ケケンカニ！''' ''Ransack!! {{tt|Kekenkani|Crabominable}} the Don!'') is the 21st chapter of the {{MangaArc|Sun, Moon, Ultra Sun & Ultra Moon}} of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga.

==Plot==
{{spoilers}}
{{Incomplete plot}}
==Major events==
* [[Hala]], [[Olivia]], and [[Nanu]] agree to make [[Hapu]] the next [[island kahuna]] of [[Poni Island]].
* While Hala fends off a {{p|Buzzwole}} and {{p|Kartana}}, Olivia and Nanu go to protect their respective islands from [[Ultra Beast]]s.
* {{adv|Sun}}, {{adv|Moon}}, and [[Anabel]] head to Poni Island. 
* Sun goes ahead to find someone who knows where {{p|Tapu Fini}} is, only to have his [[Mirage Berry]] stolen by a pair of {{p|Crabrawler}}.
* Sun follows the Crabrawler to their [[Seafolk Village]] hideout, led by a {{p|Crabominable}}.
* After being beaten by Crabominable, Sun is rescued by Hapu.
{{Adventuresevents}}
{{endspoilers}}

